<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan 40-day NCDs single yield at 5.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan 40-day NCDs single yield at 5.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank issued T$5 billion in 40-day negotiable certificates of deposits on Saturday at a single yield of 5.00 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$13.2 billion. ($1 - T$27.5) -- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
